# Package management

Never run `uv add`, `uv remove`, `uv lock`, or `uv sync` on the host.

All dependency changes go through Docker via the Makefile:

```bash
make uv-add PKG="package>=1.0"
make uv-remove PKG=package
make uv-lock
make uv-lock-regenerate
make uv-update
make uv-update PKG=foo
```

Do not hand-edit `pyproject.toml` / `uv.lock` to add or drop dependencies. Tests and lint also run in Docker: `make tests`, `make lint`, `make format`.
